    <description>If Insertion Order Attached is changed to true on Opportunity - update the Opportunity&apos;s Support Rep and Core IO based on Opportunity and Account record types

Opp: Agency + Account: Not Core or AGP
- Set Opportunity Core IO to true
- Set Opportunity Support Rep via Round Robin of CSMs

Opp: Agency +  Account: Core
-Set Opportunity Core IO to true
-Set Opportunity Support Rep as the Account’s Support Rep

Opp: Accelerated + Amount &lt;10K + Account: Not AGP or AGP Premier
- Set Opportunity Support Rep via Round Robin of AGP BCs

Opp: Accelerated + Amount &lt;10K + Account: AGP
- Set Opportunity Support Rep as the Account’s Support Rep

Opp: Accelerated + Amount &gt;10K + Account: Not AGP Premier
- Set Opportunity Support Rep via Round Robin of AGP Premier reps

Opp: Accelerated + Amount &gt;10K + Account: AGP Premier
- Set Opportunity Support Rep as the Account’s Support Rep

S3P-970
S3P-1021 - If Type if Core or Accelerated but there is no Support Rep, round robin Support Rep
S3P-1034 - When assigning a BC use Public Group Support_Reps
S3P-851 - Added assignment of AGP Premier Support Rep when the Accelerated Opp&apos;s Amount is 10K or more.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
